# Terms belonging to the tenants this repository is NOT. One extended regular expression per line;
# matched case-insensitively against every staged path and every staged byte. Whole-line comments
# and blank lines are ignored. See guards/tenant-guard.sh.
#
# This repository is the public, tenant-free layer: it may name itself and its owner, and nothing
# else. Everything below is either a private repository of the estate that extracted it, a machine
# or account belonging to that estate, or a planning artefact that has no business in a public tree.

