# Planning artefacts — the references an open-source review otherwise re-greps by hand.
# The two code shapes exclude a preceding `.`, `/`, `-` or `_` so a filename extension
# (`.p8`) is not read as a phase code.
(^|[^A-Za-z0-9._/-])W[0-9]{2,3}([^0-9A-Za-z]|$)
(^|[^A-Za-z0-9._/-])P[0-9][a-z]?([^0-9A-Za-z]|$)
docs/cross-app
roadmap\.md
monorepo

